OL,3,GNEWSAAuthorities investigate death of
OL,4,Aman at company
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Worcestershire company has said it is
OL,7,Fworking with authorities investigating
OL,8,Fthe death of a man at its site in
OL,9,FRedditch.
OL,11,FJeremy Cieslik, chief executive of
OL,12,FMettis Aerospace, said: "It is with
OL,13,Fdeep sadness that we confirm the death
OL,14,Fof one of our colleagues on site."
OL,16,FIt is understood the man died at the
OL,17,Fsite on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
